&lt;li&gt;Oversee account manager engagement to ensure timely, effective communication and the appropriate negotiation of client priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cultivate cross-functional internal relationships to serve as a strategic escalation point for complex issues across the book of business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage team caseloads and performance with a focus on maintaining high retention rates and anticipating client needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve systemic operational hurdles to ensure permanent resolution of recurring issues and improve the overall client experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Govern compliance with Service Level Agreements (SLAs) to ensure timely service delivery for critical and sensitive partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive operational excellence by optimizing processes and tools that empower the team to resolve escalations and identify growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
