&lt;li&gt;1+ years of experience in the retirement industry, demonstrating a comprehensive understanding of 401(k)/403(b) plan functions and the retirement product life-cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possession of a QKA or QKS designation, or a commitment to begin the certification process within 30 days of hire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead and mentor a team in a fast-paced environment, leveraging internal subject matter experts to resolve issues for critical partners and high-revenue clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate complex tools and resources to drive results and optimize processes without direct oversight, leading with autonomy and customer obsession.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional organizational and data aptitude; able to manage team caseloads, prioritize competing deadlines, and oversee multiple high-visibility projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate with confidence, professionalism, and empathy across all levels of an organization, from internal stakeholders to executive-level client partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to remain composed in high-stress situations while conveying empathy for both customers and employees, especially during critical escalations.&lt;/li&gt;
