&lt;li&gt;Be a role model to foster a culture of collaboration, accountability and strategic thinking across your team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive initiatives forward, managing internal and external stakeholders to ensure that we can consistently meet all of the needs of our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive initiatives that elevate the customer experience and increase operational efficiency&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, execute and enforce best-practices across the team&lt;/li&gt;
