&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Value continuous improvement - we care about documentation, security, durability, not just throwing features over the wall.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help each other be better engineers - we leave things better than we found it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aspire to collaborate seamlessly - we ensure our software is improving the customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
